Settlements - Authors and Contributors
======================================

"Breeze and the Settlements contributors" in the LICENSE-ASSETS file refers to
the people recorded here. This list is curated by the project maintainers;
contributors are added when their work is merged. The Git commit history remains
the authoritative record of who contributed what.

Assets (art, textures, sounds, models) - licensed under CC BY 4.0:
  - Breeze (breeze-devs) - all original artwork and sound to date

Code - licensed under GPLv3:
  - The Git commit history is the authoritative record of code authorship.

Third-party and Minecraft-derived assets are NOT covered by the above and are
credited separately in CREDITS.md.
